Subject: [PATCH 09/12] sc-compose final: hbcSecure_compose (steps 3-5: the
 hybrid argument over the runs, the hybrid model, the total)

The hybrid argument over the runs (Chain.lean: abs_chain_le, with the published
acceptProb_update for resampling run i), the reduction of one hybrid step to rho's security with
the worst-case template as advice (Template.lean: exists_gap_le; Lengths.lean: the template is
polynomially long), the reduction to the hybrid model through Phi, and Alice's and Bob's sides
(SideA.lean: exists_simA; SideB.lean: exists_simB). hbcSecure_compose is proved from them; the
module title drops "(statement phase)" and the sketch describes the delivered proof.
